  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8484;</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>800</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______."
  },
